        "body": "NAICS 541618 obligations fell 81.0% year over year. FY25 obligations totaled $843M, and FY26 to date obligations are $160M. The drop follows a peak of $1.3B in FY24 and a decline to $843M in FY25."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Which agencies and vendors dominate FY2026 to date buying?",
        "body": "The Department of Health and Human Services obligated $55M and the Department of Defense obligated $53.6M. ISLAND PEER REVIEW ORGANIZATION INC received $52.4M and PALANTIR USG INC received $27.1M. The top ten buyers range from $55M down to $1.3M and the top ten vendors range from $52.4M down to $4.6M."
      }
    ]
  },
